            <section>
              <paragraph xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/" xhtml:class="p1">No matter how big or small, our goal is always to create social good through marketing campaigns that will make an impact in people's lives and within their community.</paragraph>
            </section>
